<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>2.5.3: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00446</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.5.3: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>b5edda7a-ed34-497a-84ea-e469525fe092</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section>
    <para>A mechanic’s garage purchased 8 brake pads and 5
    headlight sets for inventory and paid $1,460. Later, the mechanic purchased
    another order of 6 of the same brake pads and 5 of the same headlight sets and
    paid $1,220. How much does each part cost?</para>
  </section>
</content>
</document>
